[% /* Generates the operations artifact. */ %]# Operations

## Observability

The generated handlers emit structured logs, generated metric hooks, and tracer hooks. Wire these to your organization observability backend where required.

## Validation

- Run `./scripts/validate-template.sh` before deployment.
- Run `./scripts/validate-contracts.sh` after contract changes.
- Review `generated/reports/manual-actions.md` before production export.

## Local emulator diagnostics

Run `source scripts/emulator-env.sh` and `aws sts get-caller-identity` to verify endpoint wiring.
The selected provider is controlled by `AWS_EMULATOR=floci|localstack`; keep emulator-only tests
separate from production-account evidence.

